  "title": "January 2026 HuBMAP Workshop: Introduction to the HuBMAP Data Portal",
  "bodyHtml": "<div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">The Human BioMolecular Atlas Program is working to catalyze the development of a framework for mapping healthy human tissue at single cell resolution. The HuBMAP Data Portal aims to share this multi-modal spatial and single cell data with the research community.&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">This </span><a href=\"https://hubmapconsortium.org/january-2026-hubmap-workshop/\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">hands-on workshop</span></a><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\"> will provide a foundational overview of HuBMAP, including:&nbsp;</span></div><ul><li><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">An introduction to the Anatomical Structures, Cell Types, and Biomarkers (ASCT+B) tables and the reference atlas generated from project data.&nbsp;</span></div></li><li><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">The kinds of data available through the Data Portal and how to search and discover datasets of interest by modality, assays and organs.&nbsp;</span></div></li><li><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Using and interpreting the visualizations available through the Data Portal.&nbsp;</span></div></li><li><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">How to download data including how the project data is organized.&nbsp;</span></div></li><li><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">Analyzing data in-place using HuBMAP Workspaces.&nbsp;</span></div></li></ul><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">To participate, please apply here by January 22nd:&nbsp;</span><a style=\"background-repeat:no-repeat;border:0px solid rgb(186, 188, 189);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0, 127, 162);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration-color:inherit;text-decoration-style:inherit;\" href=\"https://cmu.zoom.us/meeting/register/arrgnX_tScmpMj75-IVlZw#/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://cmu.zoom.us/meeting/register/arrgnX_tScmpMj75-IVlZw%23/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1768409290735000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2bSnW17a5Gyxpz8GNrmD6T\">https://cmu.zoom.us/<wbr>meeting/register/arrgnX_<wbr>tScmpMj75-IVlZw#/</a><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;\">If you have questions, please contact:&nbsp;</span><a style=\"background-repeat:no-repeat;border:0px solid rgb(186, 188, 189);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0, 127, 162);font-family:Roboto, sans-serif;font-size:14px;margin:0px;padding:0px;text-decoration-color:inherit;text-decoration-style:inherit;\" href=\"mailto:help@hubmapconsortium.org\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">help@<wbr>hubmapconsortium.org</a></div>",
